{"id":"word:hebrew:H3967","type":"word","title":"מֵאָה","subtitle":"H3967 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a hundred ; also as a multiplicative and a fraction","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מֵאָה (H3967) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 583 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מֵאָה (mêʼâh) means a hundred ; also as a multiplicative and a fraction First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 42."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מֵאָה","transliteration":"mêʼâh","pronunciation":"may-aw'","strong":"H3967","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3967","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["מֵא֖וֹת","מֵאֽוֹת","מֵא֥וֹת","מֵאָ֥ה","מֵא֣וֹת"],"morphs":[["HAcbpa",305],["HAcbsa",100],["HAcbda",46],["HC/Acbsa",34],["HC/Acbda",28],["HTd/Acbpa",20],["HC/Acbsc",16],["HAcfsc",8],["HR/Acbsa",7],["HC/Td/Acbpa",6]]},"definitions":{"short":"a hundred ; also as a multiplicative and a fraction","usage":"hundred((-fold), -th), sixscore.","full":"H3967. meah or meyah I. מֵאָה 583 noun feminine hundred (Late Hebrew id. ; MI 20 מאתן (dual); SI 5 מאתים מאת, (dual); Phoenician מאתם מאת (dual); Assyrian mê (probably, Dl § 75 ), Tel Amarna mê-at Wkl TelAm 20 *; Arabic Sabean מאתם מאת Os ZMG x. 1856, 49 ; CIS iv. i. 6, 4; 46, 6 ; מאה Eut Sin 457 ; Ethiopic ; Aramaic מְאָה , ; Palmyrene מאה תלת 300Vog Palm 6, 4 ; Nabataean מאה Eut Nab 8, 9 ); — ׳מ Gen 6:3 144t.; construct מְאַת 5:3 30 t. (on מְאַת Eccl 8:12 see 2d below); plural absolute מֵאוֺת Gen 5:9 324t. ( מֵאֹת only 5:4 , 30 ); המאיות Kt 2Kin 11:4 3 t. 2 Kings 11; dual מָאתַיִם ( תָ֑יִם -) Gen 11:19 76t. (but 1Sam 18:27 read מֵאָה ( מְאַת ) ᵐ5 We Dr Kit Bu HPS); — hundred: — 1 as simple number: a. absolute singular , (I) following by singular of noun enumerated: קְשִׂיטָה מֵאָה Gen 33:19 ; Josh 24:32 (both E); ׳מ אִישׁ Judg 7:19 ; 1Kin 18:13 ; 2Kin 4:43 ; ׳מ אַמָּה 1Kin 7:2 ; Ezek 40:19 +; ׳מ כִּכָּר 2Kin 23:33 ; 2Chr 25:6 ; 27:5 ; 36:3 ; Ezra 8:26 ; ׳מ אֶלֶף = 100, 000 1Kin 20:29 6 t. Kings Chronicles; compare also Gen 17:17 (P), 2Sam 8:4 ; Isa 65:20 (twice in verse), and followed by collective noun רֶכֶב 2Sam 8:4 = 1Chr 18:4 , צאֹן 1Kin 5:3 ; (2) less often followed by plural שְׁעָרִים מֵאָה Gen 26:12 (J), ׳מ מְּעָמִים 2Sam 24:3 = 1Chr 21:3 , ׳מ נְבִיאִים 1Kin 18:4 , etc.; (3) seldom, and late, preceded by plural noun: מֵאָה הָרִמֹּנִים Jer 52:23 , הַמֵּאָה אַמּוֺת Ezek 42:2 , compare Ezra 2:69 ; 2Chr 3:16 ; 4:8 ; 29:32 ; (4) exceptional is כֶסֶף כְּלֵי לְכִּכָּרִים מֵאָה Ezra 8:26 ; also, with ellipsis, כֶסֶף מֵאָה Deut 22:19 (i.e. shekels); קַיִץ מֵאָה 2Sam 16:1 (i.e. cakes); (5) מֵאָה without noun enumerated, especially = a hundred (men, persons) Judg 20:10 (twice in verse); Amos 5:3 (twice in verse); Lev 26:8 (twice in verse) (H), 1Chr 12:14 ; ׳מ Prov 17:10 100(blows), Eccl 6:3 100(children), 8:12 100(times). — On Neh 3:1 ; 12:39 see below b. absolute dual , (I) foll, by singular, אִישׁ מָאתַיִם 1Sam 18:27 ; 30:10 ; 2Sam 15:11 , ׳מ לֶחֶם 1Sam 25:18 ; 2Sam 16:1 , ׳מ צִנָּה 1Kin 10:16 2Chr 9:15 , ׳מ אֶלֶף 1Sam 15:4 +, ׳מ שָׁנָה Gen 11:23 (P); (2) less often followed by plural ׳מ שְׁקָלִים Josh 7:21 (JE), 2Sam 14:26 , ׳מ דְּבֵלִים 1Sam 25:18 , ׳מ אֲנָשִׁים 30:21 , compare Ezra 8:4 ; (3) also preceded by plural noun: מ ׳עִוִּים Gen 32:15 , מ ׳רְחֵלִים 32:15 (E), מ ׳הָרִמּוֺנִים 1Kin 7:20 , compare 1Chr 15:8 ; 2Chr 29:32 ; Ezra 2:65 ; (4) with ellipsis ׳מ כֶּסֶף Judg 17:4 ; (5) as predicate, מ ׳רָאשֵׁיהֶם 1Chr 12:32 (33 van d. H). c. absolute plural ׃מֵא(וֺ)ת — (1) alone, = hundreds , לְמֵאוֺת 1Sam 29:2 by hundreds , so 2Sam 18:4 (both + thousands); especially (הַ)מּ ׳שָׂרֵי captains of (the) hundreds Exod 18:21 , 25 (E), 2Kin 11:4 , 9 , 10 , 15 +; (2) multiplied, followed by noun enumerated, in singular: מ ׳שְׁלשׁ אִישׁ Judg 7:6 , 300 men , compare 7:7 ; 7:8 ; 7:16 ; 8:4 ; Exod 12:27 (E), etc.; מ ׳אַרְבַּע שָׁנָה Gen 15:13 (JE) 400 years ; מ ׳חֲמֵשׁ אֶלֶף 2Sam 24:9 500, 000 , compare 2Chr 13:17 ; מ ׳שֵׁשׁ רֶכֶב Exod 14:7 (J) 600 chariots ; ׳מ שְׁבַע אִישׁ Judg 20:15-16 , 700 men ; מ ׳שְׁמֹנֶה חָלָל 2Sam 23:8 800 slain ; מ ׳תְּשַׁע רֶכֶב Judg 4:3 , 13 900 chariots ; (3) less often followed by plural noun: מ ׳שְׁלשׁ שׁוּעָלִים 15:4 300 foxes ; מ ׳חֲמֵשׁ אֲתוֺנוֺת Job 1:3 500 she-asses , etc.; (4) rare, and chiefly late, after plural noun מ שְׁלשׁ ׳מִּלַגְשִׁים 1Kin 11:3 300 concubines , compare 7:42 2Chr 4:13 ; 1Chr 4:42 ; 2Chr 14:8 etc.; after n.collective מ חֲמֵשׁ ׳בָּקָר 35:9 ; (5) rare is מ ׳חֲמֵשׁ בַּשֶּׁקֶל Exod 30:24 (P); (6) ellipsis of n., מ ׳שְׁלשׁ כֶּסֶף Gen 45:22 (E), etc. d. construct singular, only followed by singular, and late: מְאַתשָֿׁנָה Gen 11:10 ; 21:5 ; 25:7 (all P) + 25 t. P, 1Chr 25:9 ; Est 1:4 (Dr Intr. 124 ) (also with other numerals, see 2 below); מְאַ֖ת Eccl 8:12 100 times מְּעָמִיםׅ (מֵאָה , sc. מַּעַם , or perhaps only apparently construct (Kö ii. 228 compare Ew § 269 b. 279 e ). — Neh 5:11 see 3 below 2 as part of larger number: a. usually preceding tens and units , (1) with noun expressed once, or not at all, earlier usage, usually with וְ before ten if no unit follows, otherwise without וְ before ten (see Kö ii. 218 ff. ): שָׂרִים וְעֶשֶׂר מֵאָה Judg 2:8 ; מֵאוֺת שֵׁשׁ כִּכָּר וָשֵׁשׁ שִׁשִּׁים 1Kin 10:14 666 talents , etc. (exceptions are Neh 7:24 and 7:31 ); (2) chiefly late, with noun and וְ repeated: וְשֶׁבַע שָׁנִים מֵאָה שָׁנָה וְעֶשְׂרִים שָׁנָה Gen 23:1 (P) (compare אמה ומאת אמה ואלף SI 5.6 Da Expos. Times. May, 1898 ). b. less often, following tens and units , chiefly late, with וְ repeated: — וּמֵאָה עֶשְׂרִים Num 7:86 (P); שָׁנָה וּמְאַת וּשְׁלשִׁים שֶׁבַע Exod 6:16 (P), etc.; with noun after ten and after hundred, שָׁנָה מֵאוֺת וּשְׁלשׁ שָׁנָה וְשִׁשִּׁים חָמֵשׁ Gen 5:23 (P), etc. &#8212; On these usages see, further, Kö ii. 217 ff. Da Synt. §§ 36 R. 3, 37 (d) Ges §§ 97, 134 and especially Herner Synt. d. Zahlw-rter im AT (1893). 3 הַכֶּסֶף מְאַת Neh 5:11 = a hundredth part of the money ; but read quite possibly מַשַּׁאת the debt (Gei Jüd. Zeitschr. viii. 1870, 227 Gr .) מְאָיוֺת Kt see מֵאָה . מַאֲכֶ֫לֶת מַאֲכֹ֫לַת, מַאֲכָל, see אבל . [ מַאֲמַצִּים מַאֲמָץ, ] see אמץ . [ מַאֲמָר ] see אָמַר . מְאָה noun feminine hundred (see Biblical Hebrew); — absolute ׳מ after noun enumerator, Ezra 6:17 ; 7:22 (4 t. in verse), so מ ׳אַרְבַּע 6:17 , ׳מ וְעֶשְׂרִין Dan 6:1 , and dual מָאתַ֫וִן Ezra 6:17 . מאֹזַנְוָא see אזן . מֵאמַר see אמר .","rootNote":"or מֵאיָה ; properly, a primitive numeral","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 42","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 42","1Chr 5 18","1Chr 5 21","1Chr 5 21","1Chr 7 2","1Chr 7 9","1Chr 7 11","1Chr 8 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":583,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 42","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵא֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵא֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מָאתַ֤יִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbda"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ֥אָה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵאֽוֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מָאתָֽיִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbda"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מָאתַ֔יִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acbda"},{"reference":"1Chr 8 40","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵאָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcbsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵא֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph